WEBVTT

00:21.750 --> 00:24.000
Please cry in my stead.

00:24.180 --> 00:25.000
This is...

00:25.350 --> 00:29.000
It's the place where everything begins, and where everything ends.

00:29.650 --> 00:32.670
Love, I've got to feel it

00:32.950 --> 00:35.760
If you put your trust in me

00:36.270 --> 00:39.520
I know what my life would be

00:39.590 --> 00:44.410
Oh, you are all I ever need

00:44.570 --> 00:50.110
No one can stand in your way

00:50.260 --> 00:52.380
Here I stay

00:52.460 --> 00:55.960
There'll be another day

00:57.400 --> 01:03.120
Won't cry and get rid of scars

01:03.550 --> 01:06.750
Always in my heart

01:06.870 --> 01:14.930
Gotta find a way to start

01:16.890 --> 01:20.640
I wonder why my tears come at night

01:20.640 --> 01:24.150
Calling you, so like a little child

01:24.310 --> 01:27.390
All the things you have in mind

01:27.650 --> 01:30.770
I wish I could see your insides

01:30.770 --> 01:33.800
My love, you've got to feel it

01:33.800 --> 01:37.110
And if we put our trust in you and me

01:37.320 --> 01:40.770
You know what our lives would be

01:40.890 --> 01:48.730
Oh, you are the one, I believe

02:19.980 --> 02:22.730
Something so childish...

02:19.980 --> 02:22.730
er of challenge

02:27.630 --> 02:30.710
Why do I feel relieved?

02:30.710 --> 02:32.310
I was supposed to have thrown everything away.

02:32.310 --> 02:34.330
I was supposed to have cleared everything up.

02:36.080 --> 02:40.090
What am I... hoping for?

02:45.590 --> 02:48.140
What happened to the part of me that never loses?

02:48.140 --> 02:51.390
He never really existed.

02:51.830 --> 02:54.710
If you get involved with her, you'll end up hurting her.

02:54.710 --> 02:57.320
If you hurt her, then you'll hurt yourself.

02:57.320 --> 03:00.860
But... I can't live if I avoid that, can I?

03:01.330 --> 03:02.980
You're going to die soon.

03:04.230 --> 03:07.240
Yeah. But I'm alive right now.

03:07.240 --> 03:09.360
You're going to make an effort just to lose?

03:09.360 --> 03:11.740
You're going to make an effort just to hurt her?

03:11.740 --> 03:13.600
Even with that, I...

03:14.750 --> 03:16.250
I...

03:26.220 --> 03:27.260
Disappear!

03:29.510 --> 03:30.260
Disappear!

03:30.260 --> 03:31.510
Just disappear!

03:37.520 --> 03:38.520
I...

03:40.250 --> 03:42.770
want to... see her!

04:03.980 --> 04:05.550
Welcome back.

04:09.550 --> 04:11.740
Chest!

04:20.860 --> 04:23.110
What was that about, all of a sudden?!

04:23.110 --> 04:25.480
Didn't I write "A letter of challenge" on it?

04:25.480 --> 04:26.230
Eh?

04:26.230 --> 04:28.740
You've already died once.

04:28.740 --> 04:29.740
Huh?

04:29.740 --> 04:32.650
They say, "Idiots will still be idiots after they die",

04:32.650 --> 04:35.490
but how do you feel now that you've died once?

04:36.490 --> 04:37.930
Nice to meet you,

04:37.930 --> 04:40.250
reborn Kuze Shuichi-san.

04:43.440 --> 04:45.000
I'm Hayama Mizuki.

04:53.400 --> 04:54.930
Kuze-san,

04:54.930 --> 04:59.100
I think it's a mistake to say,
"In love, the person who falls for another loses".

04:59.100 --> 05:00.100
Huh?

05:00.100 --> 05:03.770
Having romantic feelings for another person automatically makes you a winner.

05:05.770 --> 05:09.030
I brought some answers today.

05:09.280 --> 05:10.650
Answers?

05:10.650 --> 05:13.380
You asked me some questions, didn't you, Kuze-san?

05:13.380 --> 05:15.530
I'll answer them all.

05:18.130 --> 05:21.180
Why are you in front of me?

05:21.180 --> 05:26.270
I'm in front of you because I love you.

05:26.270 --> 05:29.560
Why are you speaking to me?

05:29.560 --> 05:35.050
I'm speaking to you because I love you.

05:36.030 --> 05:40.600
I follow you around because I love you.

05:41.820 --> 05:45.650
I try to care for you because I love you.

05:48.440 --> 05:52.280
I won't leave you alone because I love you.

05:54.780 --> 05:57.320
I smile because I love you.

05:59.830 --> 06:02.870
I meddle because I love you.

06:05.370 --> 06:08.000
I'm in a good mood because I love you.

06:10.500 --> 06:13.170
I don't cry because I love you.

06:16.680 --> 06:22.480
The reason why I'm cheerful, pleasant, delightful, and joyful...

06:22.480 --> 06:25.190
is because I love you.

06:26.440 --> 06:29.510
There will probably be times when I'll hurt you.

06:29.510 --> 06:31.380
There might be times when I'll make you waver.

06:31.380 --> 06:33.940
I'll cause you distress. I'll make you suffer.

06:33.940 --> 06:36.740
But all of that is because I love you.

06:38.770 --> 06:41.490
They're all... they're all... they're all...

06:41.490 --> 06:43.830
because I love you.

06:43.830 --> 06:45.910
And that is my answer.

06:51.110 --> 06:53.340
I'm... going to die.

06:53.340 --> 06:54.340
I know.

06:54.570 --> 06:57.510
Pretty soon, I'm going to look miserable and terrible.

06:57.510 --> 06:58.510
I know.

06:58.510 --> 07:01.010
I won't be able to make you happy.

07:01.010 --> 07:02.010
No.

07:05.730 --> 07:07.990
I'll be happy.

07:07.990 --> 07:13.020
And when you're about to die,
I'll make sure that you're happy as well.

07:16.530 --> 07:19.530
So... won't you come along with me?

07:20.640 --> 07:22.030
Mizuki-chan...

07:22.030 --> 07:24.250
No matter how much you treasure them,

07:24.250 --> 07:27.490
all things will eventually perish.

07:27.490 --> 07:32.680
Bonds, feelings, memories, hearts, and even life.

07:32.680 --> 07:35.280
Everything in this world eventually perishes.

07:35.280 --> 07:37.240
Everything eventually breaks.

07:37.240 --> 07:41.550
Happiness is just artificial, fictional, fake.

07:41.550 --> 07:43.020
So...

07:43.050 --> 07:44.180
So...

07:44.560 --> 07:46.930
I tried to settle everything.

07:47.950 --> 07:48.940
So...

07:49.180 --> 07:50.940
Let's cherish it!

07:52.090 --> 07:56.420
So that we'll have no regrets when the time comes for us to say farewell.

07:56.420 --> 08:00.700
Because it will break, let's cherish it. Let's cherish it until that time.

08:03.670 --> 08:04.950
Why...

08:05.950 --> 08:08.460
Why me?

08:08.460 --> 08:09.460
That's because...

08:10.600 --> 08:12.470
you're Kuze-san.

08:16.960 --> 08:20.770
To put it bluntly, it was your bad luck that I fell for you,

08:20.770 --> 08:23.970
so please just be happy.

08:25.880 --> 08:27.340
I see...

08:27.340 --> 08:28.730
Fine.

08:28.730 --> 08:29.980
Kuze-san!

08:29.980 --> 08:30.980
Come here.

08:36.980 --> 08:38.490
Ouch...

08:38.490 --> 08:40.240
That was payback for earlier.

08:40.240 --> 08:41.660
How cruel!

08:41.660 --> 08:44.240
This is where you're supposed to kiss me gently!

08:56.830 --> 08:58.170
Kuze-san?

08:58.760 --> 09:00.340
Kuze-san!

09:23.360 --> 09:24.360
How is Kuze-san?

09:24.890 --> 09:26.870
It seems like he's going to live.

09:28.870 --> 09:32.530
But... the progress of his disease is unpredictable.

09:32.530 --> 09:35.380
If there's another attack, then he's done for.

09:36.130 --> 09:37.040
That's...

09:37.040 --> 09:38.960
Can't something be done?

09:38.960 --> 09:40.710
Surgery, or something...

09:40.950 --> 09:44.970
If that was possible, then he would've tried it long ago.

09:45.720 --> 09:49.120
The success rate for surgery is remarkably low.

09:49.120 --> 09:51.220
If it fails, then he'll die immediately.

09:57.310 --> 10:02.280
Even if the surgery is successful, the chances that he'll survive for three years are less than 50%.

10:02.280 --> 10:05.240
While the risk is huge, the gain is small.

10:05.240 --> 10:06.490
No way...

10:41.360 --> 10:43.360
I'm not going to cry.

10:43.440 --> 10:45.730
I'm... not going to cry.

10:45.730 --> 10:48.360
No matter what happens...

10:48.360 --> 10:51.120
I promised Yuko!

10:55.230 --> 10:56.380
Hello?

10:56.380 --> 10:57.870
Hayama, it's me.

10:58.120 --> 10:59.630
Hiro-senpai?

11:00.080 --> 11:01.530
I heard from Kei.

11:01.530 --> 11:02.720
Are you all right?

11:02.720 --> 11:04.370
O-Of course!

11:04.370 --> 11:06.840
I'm always full of energy!

11:06.840 --> 11:08.250
I see.

11:08.250 --> 11:10.740
I'm also a fan of Kuze Shuichi.

11:10.740 --> 11:12.640
Tell him to persevere for me.

11:13.140 --> 11:15.650
Yes, roger.

11:15.650 --> 11:17.140
And also...

11:17.140 --> 11:18.900
Um... how to say this...

11:19.130 --> 11:21.060
Well...

11:21.060 --> 11:23.020
You hold out too, all right?

11:24.280 --> 11:28.030
Okay. Thanks a lot, Hiro-senpai.

11:28.270 --> 11:29.530
Later.

11:32.530 --> 11:34.040
Mizuki!

11:34.280 --> 11:35.790
My friends!

11:35.790 --> 11:37.140
Are you all right?

11:37.140 --> 11:41.500
I'm sure it's a difficult time for you, but please don't be discouraged.

11:43.220 --> 11:44.600
I'll be fine.

11:44.600 --> 11:50.010
Whenever I'm having problems,
someone always appears and supports me.

11:51.260 --> 11:55.430
The two of you gave me a lot of energy just now.

11:55.430 --> 11:57.270
So I'll be fine.

11:57.270 --> 11:59.280
I see. Thank goodness.

11:59.280 --> 12:00.020
Yep!

12:02.020 --> 12:06.920
I also had someone give me a push when I was going through hard times.

12:06.920 --> 12:08.690
Was that Tsutsumi-senpai?

12:08.690 --> 12:11.130
Of course not!

12:11.130 --> 12:15.700
Not him, but a woman with long hair.

12:15.990 --> 12:21.460
I heard from him later on, but apparently Tsutsumi-senpai has met her before, too.

12:23.680 --> 12:28.460
After meeting her, I resolved to start trying again.

12:31.560 --> 12:36.970
After meeting her, I found something precious to me.

12:37.470 --> 12:42.370
After meeting her, I found a place to return to.

12:43.480 --> 12:48.300
After meeting her, I found the colors I was looking for.

12:52.600 --> 12:59.080
itsuka atarashii sekai ni

12:52.600 --> 12:59.080
Fly high, make it, get to the new world that I seek

12:59.080 --> 13:05.330
habatakeru no

12:59.080 --> 13:05.330
Someday, so I believe

13:05.330 --> 13:11.720
toba ni naranai kinou ni wa

13:05.330 --> 13:11.720
Don't look back to the sorrow I left behind,

13:11.720 --> 13:18.260
kokoro kakushiteru

13:11.720 --> 13:18.260
Here's the real intention I hide,

13:18.260 --> 13:24.690
nakushita iro torikaesu wa

13:18.260 --> 13:24.690
I wish you were here, and so just right by my side,

13:24.690 --> 13:30.780
kireta ito tsunagu you

13:24.690 --> 13:30.780
Need to be strong enough to swallow my pride.

13:30.780 --> 13:36.760
kieta oto wo tsumugu

13:30.780 --> 13:36.760
I have been looking for my own style,

13:36.760 --> 13:43.870
yuuki wo yuriokosu

13:36.760 --> 13:43.870
Don't give it up, here comes the life.

13:46.980 --> 13:59.740
kibou ni hikaru tsubasa mitsukedasu kara kitto

13:46.980 --> 13:59.740
Be alive, take it, Promise to find, yes I will,
Shining wings filled with wishes.

13:59.740 --> 14:06.310
istuka atarashii sekai ni

13:59.740 --> 14:06.310
Fly high, make it, get to the new world that I seek

14:06.310 --> 14:13.340
habatakeru no

14:06.310 --> 14:13.340
Someday, so I believe

14:24.910 --> 14:26.500
I wonder how much longer...

14:26.500 --> 14:29.000
we can stay like this.

14:29.000 --> 14:30.500
Kuze-san...

14:30.500 --> 14:32.510
Sorry for all the trouble I've caused.

14:35.600 --> 14:40.510
The spoils of a battle that you knew you'd win don't mean very much, do they?

14:40.730 --> 14:43.520
That's why I could throw everything away easily.

14:43.740 --> 14:45.770
I could settle matters easily.

14:46.420 --> 14:48.020
Kuze-san...

14:48.020 --> 14:52.190
I finally realized that I might just have lost.

14:52.190 --> 14:57.280
If I could gain something from that,
the battle would've been worthwhile.

15:00.280 --> 15:02.790
This is also thanks to you, Mizuki-chan.

15:02.790 --> 15:04.040
Kuze-san!

15:04.630 --> 15:06.040
Do you want to have a competition?

15:06.040 --> 15:07.290
Huh?

15:07.450 --> 15:08.790
I'm talking about the surgery.

15:09.700 --> 15:10.540
But...

15:10.540 --> 15:13.050
The chances that I'll lose are great.

15:13.050 --> 15:16.300
Even if I win, the respite I'll earn is negligible.

15:16.300 --> 15:17.300
But...

15:17.610 --> 15:21.580
Even if it gives me just another second to spend with you,

15:21.580 --> 15:23.310
I think it's worth fighting for.

15:23.310 --> 15:24.560
Kuze-san...

15:24.820 --> 15:26.340
This is the first time

15:26.340 --> 15:28.770
that I'm going to accept a challenge I'll probably lose.

15:30.500 --> 15:33.440
Kuze-san, for a dream to come true,

15:33.440 --> 15:37.440
apparently you need to have a dream to start with.

15:37.440 --> 15:38.450
Huh?

15:38.450 --> 15:41.570
Nothing will happen if you throw away your dreams.

15:41.570 --> 15:44.590
So don't give up, and keep on hoping.

15:44.590 --> 15:47.960
Supposedly, that's the first step in making a dream come true.

15:47.960 --> 15:49.460
Those words are...

15:51.210 --> 15:53.650
They're words I love.

15:53.650 --> 15:58.930
If you keep on dreaming, and don't give up, then surely your dream will come true.

15:58.930 --> 15:59.970
I see...

15:59.970 --> 16:01.120
I got it.

16:01.120 --> 16:02.720
I'll keep on dreaming.

16:02.720 --> 16:03.720
Yep!

16:08.980 --> 16:10.230
Huh?

16:12.980 --> 16:14.230
You're...

16:15.950 --> 16:17.270
Long time, no see.

16:17.270 --> 16:18.820
Do you remember me?

16:20.920 --> 16:24.710
Didn't I meet you for the first time last Christmas?

16:24.710 --> 16:27.580
You said then that you were waiting for someone, didn't you?

16:29.080 --> 16:31.000
Did you get to see him?

16:33.510 --> 16:34.500
I see.

16:36.000 --> 16:38.880
Is there anything that we can do about it?

16:40.260 --> 16:43.260
I... want to repay you for all you've done.

16:46.260 --> 16:47.820
We...

16:47.850 --> 16:49.270
We...

16:49.430 --> 16:52.270
...were able to reach a resolution, thanks to you.

16:52.270 --> 16:55.480
...were able to take a step forwards, thanks to you.

16:55.480 --> 16:56.730
Thank you.

16:58.200 --> 16:59.780
I'm Hirono Hiro.

16:59.990 --> 17:02.240
I'm Miyamura Miyako.

17:02.530 --> 17:03.490
What about you?

17:05.990 --> 17:06.990
Yuko.

17:08.800 --> 17:12.000
Amamiya... Yuko.

17:12.000 --> 17:15.500
Deep in the heart, love is hidden

17:12.000 --> 17:15.500
Remember that somehow

17:17.960 --> 17:20.190
Himura, Nagi,

17:20.190 --> 17:22.220
how about a drink once my surgery's done?

17:22.220 --> 17:23.220
Yeah.

17:23.220 --> 17:25.200
We'll wait for you.

17:25.200 --> 17:26.970
When you're back to normal, treat me to a drink.

17:26.970 --> 17:29.470
Kuze-san, please hold on.

17:29.470 --> 17:31.510
Yeah.

17:31.510 --> 17:33.480
Miracles don't exist in the world.

17:35.470 --> 17:37.520
The only things that exist are coincidences and inevitabilities,

17:37.520 --> 17:40.090
and the actions people take.

17:40.090 --> 17:43.860
Then that means that I just have to make a miracle happen from the inevitable, right?

17:43.860 --> 17:45.110
Kuze-san...

17:47.170 --> 17:48.490
Kuze-san...

17:48.490 --> 17:50.040
Here.

17:52.940 --> 17:54.870
I'll definitely come back.

17:54.870 --> 17:56.130
Yeah.

17:58.630 --> 18:00.010
Go for it.

18:00.810 --> 18:02.050
Yeah.

18:24.490 --> 18:30.750
kanashii toki mo ureshii toki mo

18:24.490 --> 18:30.750
Even when I'm sad, and even when I'm happy,

18:31.500 --> 18:38.130
tsunaida kono te hanasanai

18:31.500 --> 18:38.130
I won't let go of the hand that I hold.

18:38.470 --> 18:44.770
issho ni ikou kono mirai wo

18:38.470 --> 18:44.770
Let's go together.

18:45.520 --> 18:52.360
egao de futari arukidasou

18:45.520 --> 18:52.360
Let's walk this future together with a smile.

20:37.590 --> 20:53.500
ikiru yuuki to idaku mirai to

20:37.590 --> 20:53.500
The courage to live and a future to embrace.

20:53.500 --> 21:09.940
minna ga kureta tsuyosa ai wo shinjite

20:53.500 --> 21:09.940
And the strength that everyone gave me... Putting our trust in love.

21:13.660 --> 21:29.540
hosoi yubisaki kirei na hitomi

21:13.660 --> 21:29.540
Your thin fingertips, and your beautiful eyes.

21:29.540 --> 21:45.130
wasurenai no memory kizamu omokage

21:29.540 --> 21:45.130
I won't forget those memories. I'll engrave your countenance on my heart.

21:50.230 --> 22:04.170
motto kitto tooku wo yume ni mezashite

21:50.230 --> 22:04.170
I'm extending my dream further as I sleep.

22:04.170 --> 22:22.020
watashi negao omoidasu fureru shiawase

22:04.170 --> 22:22.020
And I remember the happiness I felt when I touched you.

22:25.520 --> 22:40.930
sora no kanata ni todoite negai

22:25.520 --> 22:40.930
Please, wishes, reach beyond the skies.

22:41.490 --> 22:57.520
kokoro tooku tobasu wa watashi to arukou

22:41.490 --> 22:57.520
I let my heart fly away. Walk with me.

22:57.520 --> 23:05.720
zutto issho de

22:57.520 --> 23:05.720
Together forever,

23:09.660 --> 23:19.570
futari istumade

23:09.660 --> 23:19.570
just the two of us.

23:25.830 --> 23:27.920
The seasons that repeat.

23:27.920 --> 23:29.780
My feelings, please reach them.

23:30.780 --> 23:33.740
ef - a tale of melodies.

23:33.740 --> 23:35.060
Forever.

23:35.850 --> 23:39.710
Can you hear it? The melody of truth.
